Sval: show a Quick Peek's prompts while it is open

A Quick Peek's page shows over the selected tab, which stays selected, and
PopupNotifications shows only the selected browser's notifications. A
prompt the Quick Peek's page raised, such as an extension install's, waited
unseen and went when the Quick Peek closed.

